{"target": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Bun - Fast JavaScript Runtime</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #0c0a0b;\n            color: #eae9e8;\n        }\n        .text-gradient {\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #f472b6, #db2777);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n        .chart-bar {\n            transition: width 0.5s ease-out;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen\">\n\n    <!-- Top Banner -->\n    <div class=\"w-full bg-black text-white text-[13px] py-[10px] flex justify-center items-center border-b border-[#222]\">\n        <span class=\"hover:underline cursor-pointer\">Bun has joined Anthropic \u2014 and Anthropic is betting on Bun \u2192</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navbar -->\n    <nav class=\"max-w-[1166px] mx-auto h-[66px] flex items-center justify-between px-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white rounded-full border-2 border-black relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 left-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 right-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3 h-1.5 border-b-2 border-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[24px] font-bold tracking-tight\">Bun</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Menu -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-[15px] text-[#dbdcdc] font-medium\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Docs</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Guides</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Reference</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Blog</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <!-- Search -->\n            <div class=\"relative group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-gray-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg>\n                </div>\n                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search docs, APIs, guides...\" class=\"bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#333] rounded-md py-1.5 pl-10 pr-12 text-[14px] w-[300px] focus:outline-none focus:border-gray-500\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[#555] text-[12px] border border-[#333] px-1.5 rounded\">/</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Icons -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-400\">\n                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 hover:text-white cursor-pointer\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z\"/></svg>\n                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 hover:text-white cursor-pointer\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.086 2.157 2.419 0 1.334-.947 2.419-2.157 2.419zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.086 2.157 2.419 0 1.334-.946 2.419-2.157 2.419z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"bg-white text-black font-bold text-[13px] px-4 py-[7px] rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors\">Install</button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-[1166px] mx-auto mt-[100px] grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 px-4\">\n        \n        <!-- Left Hero -->\n        <section>\n            <div class=\"inline-block bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#333] rounded px-2 py-0.5 mb-8\">\n                <span class=\"text-[#f472b6] text-[11px] font-bold mr-2\">NEW</span>\n                <span class=\"text-white text-[11px] font-medium opacity-80\">BUN V1.4.3 RELEASED \u2192</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-[72px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-8\">\n                Bun is a <span class=\"text-gradient\">fast</span> JavaScript runtime & toolkit. All in one.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-[20px] text-[#dbdcdc] leading-relaxed max-w-[480px] mb-12\">\n                Runtime, package manager, test runner and bundler in a single binary. Use <span class=\"underline decoration-gray-600 underline-offset-4 cursor-pointer hover:text-white\">bun install</span> or <span class=\"underline decoration-gray-600 underline-offset-4 cursor-pointer hover:text-white\">bun test</span> in an existing Node.js project, or run the whole thing on Bun.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-16\">\n                <p class=\"text-[14px] font-bold mb-4\">Install Bun v1.4.3</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-[#111] border border-[#222] rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center justify-between group max-w-[516px]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[15px]\">\n                        <span class=\"text-pink-500\">></span>\n                        <span class=\"text-gray-300\">powershell -c \"irm bun.sh/install.ps1|iex\"</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-white\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 012-2v-8a2 2 0 01-2-2h-8a2 2 0 01-2 2v8a2 2 0 012 2z\"></path></svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Right Chart -->\n        <section class=\"flex flex-col\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#0c0a0b] border border-[#222] rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n                <!-- Tabs -->\n                <div class=\"flex border-b border-[#222]\">\n                    <button class=\"flex-1 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium border-r border-[#222] bg-[#111] text-white\">bun install</button>\n                    <button class=\"flex-1 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium border-r border-[#222] text-gray-500 hover:text-white\">Express</button>\n                    <button class=\"flex-1 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium border-r border-[#222] text-gray-500 hover:text-white\">Postgres</button>\n                    <button class=\"flex-1 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-white\">WebSockets</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Chart Content -->\n                <div class=\"p-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">Installing a Next.js app</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500\">warm cache \u00b7 seconds (lower is better)</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-500 flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white\">\n                            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-pink-500 rounded-full\"></span> replay in real time\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bars -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6 relative\">\n                        <!-- Bun -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-16 text-[12px] font-mono\">\n                                <div class=\"font-bold\">bun</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-600\">v1.4</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"h-8 bg-pink-500 rounded-sm w-[5%] relative\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute -right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-6 h-6 bg-white rounded-full border border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full border border-black relative overflow-hidden scale-75\">\n                                            <div class=\"absolute top-0.5 left-0.5 w-1 h-1 bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                                            <div class=\"absolute top-0.5 right-0.5 w-1 h-1 bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[18px] font-bold\">0.21s</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Yarn -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-16 text-[12px] font-mono\">\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-400\">yarn</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-600\">v1.22.22</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"h-8 bg-[#333] rounded-sm w-[40%]\"></div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px] text-gray-400\">1.76s</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- PNPM -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-16 text-[12px] font-mono\">\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-400\">pnpm</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-600\">v11.21.0</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"h-8 bg-[#333] rounded-sm w-[45%]\"></div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px] text-gray-400\">1.92s</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- NPM -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-16 text-[12px] font-mono\">\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-400\">npm</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-gray-600\">v12.0.2</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"h-8 bg-[#333] rounded-sm w-[85%]\"></div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px] text-gray-400\">4.45s</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- X-Axis -->\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between pt-4 border-t border-[#222] text-[10px] text-gray-600 font-mono\">\n                            <span>0s</span>\n                            <span>1s</span>\n                            <span>2s</span>\n                            <span>3s</span>\n                            <span>4s</span>\n                            <span>5s</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Footer -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-[400px]\">\n                            T3-stack app, 25 direct dependencies, ~220 packages in the lockfile \u00b7 warm cache \u00b7 lockfile present \u00b7 node_modules removed \u00b7 Linux x64, EPYC 9R14 \u00b7 every package manager at defaults \u00b7 medians of 3\n                        </p>\n                        <button class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 underline hover:text-white\">reproduce</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "notes": ["Used Tailwind CSS for layout and styling, with custom hex codes for exact color matching.", "Implemented the \"Bun\" logo and chart icons using CSS shapes and SVGs for a clean, vector-like appearance.", "Applied a linear gradient for the \"fast\" text and used Inter font from Google Fonts.", "The chart bars are sized proportionally based on the time values shown in the screenshot."], "source": "ai", "provider": {"name": "google-gemini", "model": "gemini-3-flash-preview"}, "change": null, "size": {"width": 1536, "height": 674}}